# Changelogs — release team only.
# release-please rewrites a component's CHANGELOG.md on every release PR,
# so code-owner review here is the release brake: a release PR merges
# only after explicit release-team approval, and the nightly auto-cut can
# only time a merge that is already approved. The release-please config
# and manifest are deliberately NOT listed: promotions and counter reseeds
# are human edits to those files and must stay review-free.
# Anchored to the release-please-managed changelogs: a basename rule
# would also gate the scaffold changelogs under templates/ and
# internal/template/, which release-please never writes.
/CHANGELOG.md                     @hop-top/release
/incubator/qmochi/CHANGELOG.md    @hop-top/release
/sdk/experimental/php/CHANGELOG.md @hop-top/release
/sdk/experimental/rs/CHANGELOG.md @hop-top/release
/sdk/py/CHANGELOG.md              @hop-top/release
/sdk/ts/CHANGELOG.md              @hop-top/release
